{"items":[{"item":{"id":"customer-references#capital-express-netred-es-2025","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"capital-express-netred-es-2025","dateCreated":"2025-02-20T20:30:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-03-06T23:48:44+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eLa compa\u0026ntilde;\u0026iacute;a de servicios de factoring Capital Express quer\u0026iacute;a mejorar las evaluaciones de los clientes y hacer crecer su negocio, pero ten\u0026iacute;a un sistema obsoleto que dificultaba el acceso a los datos. La compa\u0026ntilde;\u0026iacute;a recurri\u0026oacute; al socio de AWS, NetRed, para migrar sus datos utilizando los servicios de Amazon Web Services (AWS). Gracias a la migraci\u0026oacute;n, Capital Express pudo crear Advance, una innovadora herramienta de gesti\u0026oacute;n financiera que ofrece un procesamiento de datos en tiempo real. La implementaci\u0026oacute;n de Advance redujo los costos operativos mensuales en un 94 por ciento. Tambi\u0026eacute;n disminuy\u0026oacute; el tiempo necesario para la inscripci\u0026oacute;n de clientes y las consultas de TI a solo cinco minutos. Estas mejoras han agilizado las operaciones y permiten una prestaci\u0026oacute;n de servicios m\u0026aacute;s r\u0026aacute;pida, lo que aumenta dr\u0026aacute;sticamente el potencial de crecimiento de Capital Express y ayuda a satisfacer las necesidades de los clientes con mayor rapidez.\u003c/p\u003e\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Capital%20Express%20Logo%20200x70px.53db0b44c9b01b2a4966a2e27211ad98a79df25b.png","displayLocation":"Chile","footerInfoText":"2025","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2025-02-20","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/capital-express-netred/","customer-name":"Capital Express","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2025","contentType":"Case Study","headline":"Capital Express Reduce los Costos Operativos Mensuales en un 94% con NetRed y AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#rds","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon RDS","description":"Amazon RDS","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#amplify","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Amplify","description":"AWS Amplify","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:15+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#sqs","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS)","description":"Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:02+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#database-migration-service","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Database Migration Service (DMS)","description":"AWS Database Migration Service (DMS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#spanish","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Spanish","description":"Spanish","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#financial-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Financial Services","description":"Financial Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#vpc","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon VPC","description":"Amazon VPC","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:06:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#chile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Chile","description":"Chile","dateCreated":"2020-07-02T22:30:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#latam","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Latin America","description":"Latin America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudformation","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS CloudFormation","description":"AWS CloudFormation","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#save-the-children-spain-devoteam-2025","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"save-the-children-spain-devoteam-2025","dateCreated":"2025-02-20T21:50:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-03-07T01:09:54+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eSave the Children Spain, part of a global NGO protecting children\u0026rsquo;s rights, faced challenges with its on-premises data management system. Unable to effectively integrate and analyze information from multiple sources, it struggled to personalize donor outreach and optimize fundraising. Partnering with AWS Premier Consulting Partner Devoteam, it implemented a cloud-based data-lake solution using Amazon Web Services (AWS). This transformation enabled seamless data integration, enhanced donor insights, and improved campaign effectiveness. The new system streamlined operations, reduced costs, and allowed Save the Children Spain to redirect more resources to humanitarian projects, benefiting children in need worldwide.\u003c/p\u003e\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Save%20the%20Children%20Logo%20200x70px.491babb980be27c18da5181b4073e5658ef5d2f5.png","displayLocation":"Spain","footerInfoText":"2025","industry":"General Public Services","sortDate":"2025-02-20","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/save-the-children-spain-devoteam/","customer-name":"Save the Children Spain","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2025","contentType":"Case Study","headline":"Save the Children Spain Cuts Costs and Improves Campaigns with Devoteam’s AWS-Powered Data Solution"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#spain","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Spain","description":"Spain","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:16+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:49+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#aurora","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Aurora","description":"Amazon Aurora","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#general-public-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"General Public Services","description":"General Public Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:04+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#appflow","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon AppFlow","description":"Amazon AppFlow","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:09:13+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:16+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#database-migration-service","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Database Migration Service (DMS)","description":"AWS Database Migration Service (DMS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#sns","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Notification Service (SNS)","description":"Amazon Simple Notification Service (SNS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:02+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#sqs","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS)","description":"Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:02+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#eventbridge","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EventBridge","description":"Amazon EventBridge","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:36+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#capital-express-netred-2025","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"capital-express-netred-2025","dateCreated":"2025-02-19T22:12:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-03-06T23:47:05+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eFactoring services company Capital Express wanted to improve client evaluations and grow its business, but it had an outdated system that made accessing data difficult. The company teamed up with AWS Partner NetRed to migrate its data using capabilities from Amazon Web Services (AWS). Migrating helped Capital Express create Advance, an innovative financial management tool that offers real-time data processing. Implementing Advance cut monthly operating costs by 94 percent. It also reduced the time needed for client enrollment and IT consultations to just five minutes. These improvements streamlined operations and enabled faster service delivery, dramatically increasing the growth potential of Capital Express and helping it meet customer needs faster.\u003c/p\u003e\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Capital%20Express%20Logo%20200x70px.53db0b44c9b01b2a4966a2e27211ad98a79df25b.png","displayLocation":"Chile","footerInfoText":"2025","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2025-02-19","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/capital-express-netred/","customer-name":"Capital Express","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2025","contentType":"Case Study","headline":"Capital Express Reduces Monthly Operating Costs by 94% with NetRed and AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+000