,"description":"French","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:24+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#general-database-migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"General Database Migration","description":"General Database Migration","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T06:37:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:41+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#innovator#accor","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#innovator","name":"Accor","description":"\u003cp\u003eNew Innovator for 2023.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-08-10T19:00:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-08-10T19:00:22+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#travel-and-hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"travel-and-hospitality","description":"\u003cp\u003eAs of 4/2023, this tag is initially being used specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#philips","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"philips","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:05:57+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-08-11T22:26:58+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eFond\u0026eacute;e en 1891, Philips est l\u0026#39;une des principales entreprises de technologies m\u0026eacute;dicales sp\u0026eacute;cialis\u0026eacute;e dans l\u0026#39;am\u0026eacute;lioration de la sant\u0026eacute; des personnes et l\u0026#39;obtention de meilleurs r\u0026eacute;sultats pour les patients. Ayant \u0026eacute;t\u0026eacute; l\u0026#39;une des premi\u0026egrave;res entreprises \u0026agrave; adopter Amazon Web Services (AWS), Philips s\u0026#39;appuie sur des dizaines de services AWS pour alimenter la plateforme HealthSuite de Philips. La plateforme aide les clients \u0026agrave; am\u0026eacute;liorer leur efficacit\u0026eacute; et la qualit\u0026eacute; de distribution gr\u0026acirc;ce \u0026agrave; des services tels que des connexions \u0026agrave; des dispositifs intelligents de niveau clinique, un cadre int\u0026eacute;gr\u0026eacute; permettant d\u0026#39;ing\u0026eacute;rer, de g\u0026eacute;rer et d\u0026#39;analyser les donn\u0026eacute;es relatives aux soins de sant\u0026eacute;, et bien plus encore. AWS offre \u0026agrave; Philips et \u0026agrave; ses clients des solutions \u0026eacute;volutives, \u0026eacute;conomique, r\u0026eacute;glementaires et conformes \u0026agrave; la loi HIPAA. Du cloud \u0026agrave; la p\u0026eacute;riph\u0026eacute;rie, Philips acc\u0026eacute;l\u0026egrave;re l\u0026#39;innovation, simplifie la s\u0026eacute;curit\u0026eacute; et la conformit\u0026eacute;, et augmente l\u0026#39;efficacit\u0026eacute; en proposant des solutions m\u0026eacute;dicales innovantes en cr\u0026eacute;ant sur AWS.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-customer-content/Lumify_with_Reacts_01-ALI-global.34b21dbd57d8d88715f9617b7ce396ccac615f78.jpg","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Innovators/philips-logo-innovator-page%401x.72da838390667ff0c4365725bd44e03a02030290.png","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"philips","footerInfoText":"Date de publication","industry":"Santé","sortDate":"2023-01-03","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/philips/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Philips","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Témoignages clients","headline":"Philips sur AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#database-migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Database Migration","description":"Database Migration","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#general-database-migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"General Database Migration","description":"General Database Migration","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T06:37:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:41+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#france","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"France","description":"France","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:48+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#french","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#lan