","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:05+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#hcls","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Healthcare \u0026 Life Sciences","description":"Healthcare \u0026 Life Sciences","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-05-14T20:13:37+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#life-sciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Life Sciences","description":"Life Sciences","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:31+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#database-migration-service","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Database Migration Service (DMS)","description":"AWS Database Migration Service (DMS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:27+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#philips-it","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"philips-it","dateCreated":"2024-11-12T00:54:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-11-12T01:13:40+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Fondata nel 1891, Philips è un\u0027azienda leader nel settore delle tecnologie per la salute, focalizzata sul miglioramento della salute delle persone e sul raggiungimento di risultati migliori per i pazienti. È stata una delle prime aziende ad adottare Amazon Web Services (AWS) e oggi si affida a dozzine di servizi AWS per alimentare la piattaforma Philips HealthSuite. La piattaforma aiuta i clienti a migliorare l’efficienza e a fornire assistenza sanitaria di qualità con servizi che includono connessioni a dispositivi intelligenti di livello clinico, un framework integrato per l\u0027acquisizione, la gestione e l\u0027analisi dei dati sanitari e altro ancora. AWS aiuta Philips a fornire ai propri clienti soluzioni scalabili, convenienti, normative e conformi a HIPAA. Dal cloud all\u0027edge, Philips accelera l\u0027innovazione, semplifica la sicurezza e la conformità e aumenta l\u0027efficienza nella fornitura di soluzioni sanitarie innovative basandosi su AWS.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-customer-content/Lumify_with_Reacts_01-ALI-global.34b21dbd57d8d88715f9617b7ce396ccac615f78.jpg","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Innovators/philips-logo-innovator-page%401x.72da838390667ff0c4365725bd44e03a02030290.png","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"philips","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Healthcare","sortDate":"2023-01-03","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/it/solutions/case-studies/innovators/philips/","customer-name":"Philips","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Storia del cliente","headline":"Philips su AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#big-data-analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","description":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:36+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#life-sciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Life Sciences","description":"Life Sciences","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:31+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":